{"parentUuid":"2dd077f8-9d21-4e9f-a394-5dfb88920d61","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e8de95e6-949d-413c-a294-67d2460838d4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QubdZ7j96mipwoj4SU1J6z","type":"tool_result","content":" README.md             |  3 ++-\n public/app.js         | 15 +++++++++++++--\n public/engine.js      | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------\n public/index.html     | 14 +++++++++++---\n public/readable.css   | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n src/uploads.mjs       |  3 ++-\n test/uploads.test.mjs | 15 +++++++++++++++\n 7 files changed, 101 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e0de50ea-1bb6-4582-a4f2-a68b9597c5ac","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:28:20.801Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" README.md             |  3 ++-\n public/app.js         | 15 +++++++++++++--\n public/engine.js      | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------\n public/index.html     | 14 +++++++++++---\n public/readable.css   | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n src/uploads.mjs       |  3 ++-\n test/uploads.test.mjs | 15 +++++++++++++++\n 7 files changed, 101 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":113,"oldLines":7,"newStart":113,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | Global trend | Market evidence |"," | Past decision | Decision Memory and the past-decision bonus |"," ","-The weight (1–10) scales the contribution: 5 counts the same as BMW data, 10 counts double, 1 counts a fifth. Customer counts shown to the PM are never inflated by the weight. Each row is matched to an existing feature automatically and can be corrected in the preview; rows without a feature are left out. Uploads are stored server-side in `data/uploads.json`, apply to the selected vehicle and market, and are always cited as **Your data**, never as BMW source material.","+The weight (1–10) scales the contribution: 5 counts the same as BMW data, 10 counts double, 1 counts a fifth. Customer counts shown to the PM are never inflated by the weight. Each row is matched to an existing feature automatically and can be corrected in the preview; rows without a feature are left out. For a demo, use the synthetic files in `demo-data/` (see its README). Uploads are stored server-side in `data/uploads.json`, apply to the selected vehicle and market, and are always cited as **Your data**, never as BMW source material."," "," ## Evidence and traceability"," "]},{"oldStart":273,"oldLines":6,"newStart":273,"newLines":7,"lines":[" test/                        Node test suite for product and audit invariants"," server.mjs                   Static file server, API routes, .env loading"," presentation/                Pitch deck (reveal.js, single file) and its assets","+demo-data/                   Synthetic CSVs for demoing evidence uploads (one per type)"," docs/                        Acceptance audit, pitch notes, screenshots"," research/                    Synthetic PM decision cases"," PRODUCT.md, DESIGN.md        Product context and pitch-deck design system"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/README.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0f523acf-e0bb-4c6f-b7da-d76a7cd932a0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","root":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":6,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"max-gsnr/Final-Hack-EHL","visibility":"unknown"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"max-gsnr/Final-Hack-EHL","visibility"