{"parentUuid":"18ff91d4-c964-4d18-b7a3-a6ffc3ddf8c3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfv9sb4XBuQbcrcSh6UTK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Works at 1920×1080 too. Last, a recapture script inside the repo, so anyone can rebuild the walkthrough after the app changes, plus a short README:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1484,"cache_read_input_tokens":639903,"output_tokens":1809,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":289},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1484},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1809,"cache_read_input_tokens":639903,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1484,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1484,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1648bd73-f923-4f2e-9f36-c0333ea7e7fb","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfv9sadDbmPan7XfrG9PQ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"4d22b4b8-add4-436d-896e-17265ac3a672","timestamp":"2026-10-11T08:43:19.980Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feather"}
{"parentUuid":"4d22b4b8-add4-436d-896e-17265ac3a672","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfv9sb4XBuQbcrcSh6UTK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NHt4g6j829xuJ77wGtYvb5","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL\" && cat > walkthrough/tools/recapture.sh <<'EOF'\n#!/bin/zsh\n# Rebuilds walkthrough/index.html from the live app. Runs a clean copy of the app in /tmp\n# (empty Decision Memory, no uploads) so the repo's data is never touched. macOS + Chrome + cwebp.\nset -e\nREPO=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../..\" && pwd)\"\nWORK=/tmp/walkthrough-capture\nPORT=4175\npkill -f \"user-data-dir=$WORK/profile\" 2>/dev/null || true\n[ -f \"$WORK/server.pid\" ] && kill \"$(cat \"$WORK/server.pid\")\" 2>/dev/null || true\nrm -rf \"$WORK/shots\" \"$WORK/webp\"; mkdir -p \"$WORK/shots\" \"$WORK/webp\"\nrsync -a --delete --exclude .git --exclude .impeccable --exclude node_modules --exclude walkthrough \"$REPO/\" \"$WORK/app/\"\n: > \"$WORK/app/data/decision-events.ndjson\"; rm -f \"$WORK/app/data/uploads.json\"\n(cd \"$WORK/app\" && PORT=$PORT node server.mjs > \"$WORK/server.log\" 2>&1 & echo $! > \"$WORK/server.pid\")\nsleep 1.5\ntrap 'kill \"$(cat \"$WORK/server.pid\")\" 2>/dev/null || true' EXIT\nnode \"$REPO/walkthrough/tools/capture.mjs\" \"http://localhost:$PORT\" \"$WORK/shots\" \"$REPO/demo-data\"\nfor f in \"$WORK\"/shots/*.png; do cwebp -quiet -q 80 -m 6 \"$f\" -o \"$WORK/webp/$(basename \"${f%.png}\").webp\"; done\nnode \"$REPO/walkthrough/tools/build.mjs\" \"$WORK/shots\" \"$WORK/webp\" \"$REPO/walkthrough/index.html\"\nEOF\nchmod +x walkthrough/tools/recapture.sh && sed -i '' 's#`--user-data-dir=/tmp/walk/profile-${Date.now()}`#`--user-data-dir=${OUT}/../profile-${Date.now()}`#' walkthrough/tools/capture.mjs && grep -c 'OUT}/../profile' walkthrough/tools/capture.mjs && cat > walkthrough/README.md <<'EOF'\n# Demo walkthrough\n\n`index.html` is a self-contained, clickable walkthrough of the live demo. Open it in Chrome; it needs no server, no internet and makes no OpenAI calls. Every screen is a real screenshot of the app.\n\n**Controls:** click the highlighted control, or press `→` / `Space` (next), `←` (back), `F` (full screen), `Home` / `End`. The chapter names at the top jump between sections.\n\n**Flow:** intro → Demo 1 (upfront requirements, evidence upload, ranking, reasoning, reorder, approve with a reason) → \"that was the brief\" → quote from a former Vodafone PM (used with his consent) → Demo 2 (a new PM onboards through the Project Diary, generates again, and the previous PM's decision appears in the reasoning as Decision Memory) → close.\n\n**Rebuild after app changes:** `walkthrough/tools/recapture.sh`. It runs a clean copy of the app in `/tmp` (the repo's data is never touched), drives it through the whole flow in headless Chrome, and rebuilds `index.html`. The run calls OpenAI for requirement wording and the storyline, so `OPENAI_API_KEY` must be set. Captions live in `tools/build.mjs`.\nEOF\nnode --test 2>&1 | grep -E \"^ℹ (pass|fail)\"; git status --short","description":"Add recapture script and README; run tests","timeout":180000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1484,"cache_read_input_tokens":639903,"output_tokens":1809,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":289},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1484},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1809,"cache_read_input_tokens":639903,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1484,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1484,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"in