{"parentUuid":"f03a6e83-a74e-45dc-afa5-478014c32cd9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvCSxJrYMvT2qg8nZZqK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Everything renders correctly—the cursor animation, competitor zoom, \"Past decision\" tag, and demo score bar with both data points. Now I'll update the walkthrough README for the new pipeline and rerun the app tests.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3071,"cache_read_input_tokens":705902,"output_tokens":1511,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":612},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3071},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1511,"cache_read_input_tokens":705902,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3071,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3071,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":2,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"e007185d-0c6e-4357-9007-a090cbdd9393","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfvCSwkNVG4JYbcMPVF3q","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"eef14824-19ab-4128-bd81-1215647aeb36","timestamp":"2026-10-11T09:17:10.260Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feather"}
{"parentUuid":"eef14824-19ab-4128-bd81-1215647aeb36","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvCSxJrYMvT2qg8nZZqK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01L7Jd9sAQPuqXjsKKVnBeWw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL\" && cat > walkthrough/README.md <<'EOF'\n# Demo walkthrough\n\n`index.html` plays a screen recording of the live demo, one clip per step, and pauses on the next control so the presenter clicks through it. Open it in Chrome and keep the `media/` folder next to it. It needs no server and no internet, and makes no OpenAI calls.\n\n**Controls:** click the highlighted control, or press `→` / `Space` (plays the next clip; pressed during a clip, it skips to its end), `←` (back, no replay), `F` (full screen), `Home` / `End`. The chapter names at the top jump between sections.\n\n**Flow:** intro → Demo 1 (upfront requirements, evidence upload, ranking, reasoning with the score breakdown, competitor sources, reorder, approve with a reason) → \"that was the brief\" → quote from a former Vodafone PM (used with his consent) → Demo 2 (a new PM onboards through the Project Diary, generates again, and the previous PM's decision appears in the reasoning as Decision Memory and in the score) → close.\n\n**Rebuild after app changes:** `walkthrough/tools/recapture.sh` (about 4 minutes). It runs a clean copy of the app in `/tmp` (the repo's data is never touched), records it in headless Chrome with a visible cursor, trims the AI waits, cuts one MP4 per step, and rebuilds `index.html` and `media/`. Needs Google Chrome, ffmpeg with libx264, cwebp, and `OPENAI_API_KEY` (the app calls OpenAI for requirement wording and the storyline while recording). Captions live in `tools/build.mjs`.\n\n| Tool | Does |\n| --- | --- |\n| `tools/record.mjs` | Drives the app and records it (Chrome screencast, 60 fps) |\n| `tools/encode.mjs` | Cuts the recording into one clip and end-frame still per step |\n| `tools/build.mjs` | Writes the player (`index.html`) and copies `media/` |\nEOF\ndu -sh walkthrough/media; ls walkthrough walkthrough/tools; node --test 2>&1 | grep -E \"^ℹ (pass|fail)\"; git status --short","description":"Update walkthrough README; run tests; show status","timeout":180000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3071,"cache_read_input_tokens":705902,"output_tokens":1511,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":612},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3071},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1511,"cache_read_input_tokens":705902,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3071,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3071,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01L7Jd9sAQPuqXjsKKVnBeWw":{"command":"cd \"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL\" && cat > walkthrough/README.md <<'EOF'\n# Demo walkthrough\n\n`index.html` plays a screen recording of the live demo, one clip per step, and pauses on the next control so the presenter clicks through it. Open it in Chrome and keep the `media/` folder next to it. It needs no server and no internet, and makes no OpenAI calls.\n\n**Controls:** click the highlighted control, or press `→` / `Space` (plays the next clip; pressed during a clip, it skips to its end), `←` (back, no replay), `F` (full screen), `Home` / `End`. The chapter names at the top jump between sections.\n\n**Flow:** intro → Demo 1 (upfront requirements, evidence upload, ranking, reasoning with the score breakdo