{"parentUuid":"31fd12e3-fdf5-419a-a1f5-564d603c04e7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvCUgX91YFbESDjeFacP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The walkthrough now plays a **screen recording of the real app**, one clip per step, instead of jumping between screenshots. All 25 steps play through, and all 50 app tests pass.\n\n- **What the audience sees:** a cursor gliding to each control and clicking, smooth scrolling, the typed reason, the loading state, and the requirements appearing. The AI waits are trimmed to about 1.4 s, and the whole demo is about 90 seconds of footage.\n- **How you drive it:** each clip ends paused on the next control, highlighted with the blue pulsing box. Click it (or press → / Space) and the next clip starts exactly where the last one ended, so it reads as one continuous journey. Pressing → during a clip skips to its end, and ← or a chapter jump shows the end state without replaying.\n- **Checked:** I clicked through all 25 steps in headless Chrome with real mouse clicks. Every clip played, every hotspot appeared at the end of its clip, and there were no errors and no network requests (no OpenAI, no CDN).\n\n**Your two additions:**\n1. **Competitor sources in demo 1:** after the reasoning, the cursor clicks \"View cited sources\", the drawer scrolls to the **9 Competitors** (Mercedes E-Class and Audi A6 reports and equipment lists, each with row and original source) and zooms in. Then it closes and continues with Move up.\n2. **Score bar split:** **Competitor data** is now its own teal segment in the app's score bar, next to customer demand, timeline fit and market evidence. For example, Drivetrain is now 44 + 32 + 10 + 5 = 91. Demo 2 ends on a new step that scrolls to the bar for Seating comfort: demand 14, timeline 35, market 2, **competitor data 5**, **past decisions 5**, for **61** versus 56 for the next requirement.\n\n**Notes:**\n- **Two-part delivery:** the walkthrough is now `walkthrough/index.html` plus a 10 MB `walkthrough/media/` folder. Keep them together; it still works offline by double-click in Chrome.\n- **Rebuilding:** `walkthrough/tools/recapture.sh` re-records everything in about 4 minutes. It needs your OpenAI key.\n- **`data/decision-events.ndjson` changed:** it has one new \"Product context evaluated\" entry from 10:59, likely from your own use of the app on port 4173. My recordings only ran on the copy in `/tmp`.\n- **Nothing is committed yet,** including the earlier pitch-deck deletion. Say the word and I'll push."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":519,"cache_read_input_tokens":710766,"output_tokens":1042,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":174},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":519},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1042,"cache_read_input_tokens":710766,"cache_creation_input_tokens":519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":519,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"95838c76-439d-42d0-b985-fc472445eecc","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfvCUg2sbATGbeW6HKdFe","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"604a24f9-0352-4a1d-b5e1-3089da5ab298","timestamp":"2026-10-11T09:17:35.366Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feat