{"parentUuid":"228e0fcc-fb7e-47c6-ae21-d39873bdd8ab","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"environment","snapshot":{"workingDirectory":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","isWorktree":false,"isGitRepo":true,"additionalWorkingDirectories":[],"platform":"darwin","shell":"zsh","osVersion":"Darwin 25.5.0"},"changes":[{"field":"workingDirectory","from":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b9bc2efd-95ac-43ba-bdae-ca69c584cff6","timestamp":"2026-10-11T09:37:03.521Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: /Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL (was /Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media)\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feather"}
{"parentUuid":"b9bc2efd-95ac-43ba-bdae-ca69c584cff6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14984327 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f2fd0637-0593-4d2d-b72b-9575017de3b6","timestamp":"2026-10-11T09:37:03.522Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14984327 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feather"}
{"parentUuid":"f2fd0637-0593-4d2d-b72b-9575017de3b6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvDya9arCyxkHJMJVZVK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three changes are in the walkthrough. I re-recorded the full flow, clicked through all 25 steps again with no errors and no network requests, and all 50 app tests pass.\n\n1. **Dictated reason:** the cursor now clicks **\"🎙 Dictate note\"**. The button turns red (\"● Listening… click to stop\") and the reason appears in the note box a few words at a time, then the button returns. Headless Chrome has no microphone, so for the recording the speech-recognition input is simulated. The on-screen behaviour is the app's real dictation. I also improved that in the app itself: words now show live while you speak instead of only at the end, and clicking the button again stops it.\n\n2. **Past date:** demo 2 is now **six months later**. Before it starts, every record from demo 1 is moved back to **14 Apr 2026**:\n   - the diary calendar shows that activity in April;\n   - the storyline covers it;\n   - Decision Memory reads \"Approved by the PM on **14 Apr 2026**\".\n\n   The divider slide says \"Demo 2 · Six months later\", and the diary caption starts with \"October: a new PM joins the project\". The date change happens only in the recording copy in `/tmp`; the repo's data is untouched.\n\n3. **5 vs 9:** I didn't change the bar's number to 9, because those are two different things. **5 is points** in the priority score; **9 is how many competitor signals** back it. More signals add points only up to a cap, which is why 9 signals give 5 points. The legend now shows both, and the same for every part: \"Customer demand 14 pts · 88 customers\", \"Market evidence 2 pts · 1 source\", \"**Competitor data 5 pts · 9 signals**\", \"Past decisions 5 pts · 1 decision\". This is live in the app too.\n\nNothing is committed yet. Still open: the earlier pitch-deck deletion, and the extra entry in `data/decision-events.ndjson` from your own use of the app. Want me to push?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":996,"cache_read_input_tokens":727419,"output_tokens":647,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":996},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":647,"cache_read_input_tokens":727419,"cache_creation_input_tokens":996,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":996,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6fe63eb9-3662-4a30-8090-209dbb161545","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfvDyYxe8VM2oStZp7Kxc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8c045376-ba33-43b6-89a3-7295c6d7acdb","timestamp":"2026-10-11T09:37:10.530Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feather"}
