{"parentUuid":"28fc94f8-11fb-4c62-95d4-78eca1f7d93b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvEWVfozXHHF2jf2JjDX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SfhKuhQQ6PiwhcTQ8iS3Ci","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL\" && git show --stat --oneline origin/main | head -12 && git add public/app.js public/engine.js public/readable.css test/engine.test.mjs test/uploads.test.mjs && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfeat: Decision Memory in reasoning and ranking, competitor score part, live dictation\n\n- Decisions recorded in the app, uploaded past decisions and the labelled demo history feed a \"Decision Memory\" section in the reasoning; approved ones add their weight to the score, rejected ones add nothing and are flagged.\n- Score breakdown splits competitor data from market evidence and shows source counts next to points (\"Competitor data 5 pts · 9 signals\").\n- Dictation shows words live while speaking; click again to stop.\n- Project Diary opens scrolled to today.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit add walkthrough && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfeat: recorded, clickable demo walkthrough\n\nwalkthrough/index.html plays a screen recording of the real app, one clip per step, pausing on the next control for the presenter to click. Covers demo 1, the challenge scope, the former Vodafone PM quote (used with consent), and demo 2 (six-months-later handover with Decision Memory). Offline; keep media/ next to index.html. tools/recapture.sh rebuilds it from a clean copy of the app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit stash push -q -m \"local: deck deletion + own decision log\" && git rebase origin/main 2>&1 | tail -3; git stash pop -q; git status --short","description":"Commit app and walkthrough, rebase onto teammate's commit","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":510,"cache_read_input_tokens":729092,"output_tokens":872,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":128},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":510},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":872,"cache_read_input_tokens":729092,"cache_creation_input_tokens":510,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":510,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01SfhKuhQQ6PiwhcTQ8iS3Ci":{"command":"cd \"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL\" && git show --stat --oneline origin/main | head -12 && git add public/app.js public/engine.js public/readable.css test/engine.test.mjs test/uploads.test.mjs && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfeat: Decision Memory in reasoning and ranking, competitor score part, live dictation\n\n- Decisions recorded in the app, uploaded past decisions and the labelled demo history feed a \"Decision Memory\" section in the reasoning; approved ones add their weight to the score, rejected ones add nothing and are flagged.\n- Score breakdown splits competitor data from market evidence and shows source counts next to points (\"Competitor data 5 pts · 9 signals\").\n- Dictation shows words live while speaking; click again to stop.\n- Project Diary opens scrolled to today.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit add walkthrough && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfeat: recorded, clickable demo walkthrough\n\nwalkthrough/index.html plays a screen recording of the real app, one clip per step, pausing on the next co