{"parentUuid":"cf917e1f-6016-43f6-bdf8-c1ae349072d7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"df1d41e8-59d7-49a4-96df-6b5b81493284","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WC9tXPciENM1Lxeo53pv3C","type":"tool_result","content":" 5 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)\nRebasing (2/2)\rSuccessfully rebased and updated refs/heads/main.\nℹ tests 54\nℹ pass 54\nℹ fail 0","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4e665dda-e7ff-48b5-9595-0f9a81ebc507","timestamp":"2026-10-11T09:44:28.277Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" 5 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)\nRebasing (2/2)\rSuccessfully rebased and updated refs/heads/main.\nℹ tests 54\nℹ pass 54\nℹ fail 0","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/public/app.js","hunks":[{"oldStart":371,"oldLines":11,"newStart":371,"newLines":7,"lines":[" function showView(view) {","   ['setup','workspace','memory','project-diary'].forEach(id=>$(id).classList.add('hidden'));","   let activeView=view;","-<<<<<<< HEAD","-  if(view==='diary'){$('project-diary').classList.remove('hidden');renderDiary();checkOpenAIStatus().then(renderDiary)}","-=======","-  if(view==='diary'){$('project-diary').classList.remove('hidden');renderDiary();const graph=$('diary-graph');graph.scrollLeft=graph.scrollWidth}","->>>>>>> f2980f5 (feat: Decision Memory in reasoning and ranking, competitor score part, live dictation)","+  if(view==='diary'){$('project-diary').classList.remove('hidden');renderDiary();const graph=$('diary-graph');graph.scrollLeft=graph.scrollWidth;checkOpenAIStatus().then(renderDiary)}","   else if(view==='overview')$('setup').classList.remove('hidden');","   else if(view==='memory'){$('memory').classList.remove('hidden');setTimeout(()=>$('memory-search').focus(),0)}","   else if(state.config)$('workspace').classList.remove('hidden');"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":15,"lines":["+# Demo walkthrough","+","+`index.html` plays a screen recording of the live demo, one clip per step, and pauses on the next control so the presenter clicks through it. Open it in Chrome and keep the `media/` folder next to it. It needs no server and no internet, and makes no OpenAI calls.","+","+**Controls:** click the highlighted control, or press `→` / `Space` (plays the next clip; pressed during a clip, it skips to its end), `←` (back, no replay), `F` (full screen), `Home` / `End`. The chapter names at the top jump between sections.","+","+**Flow:** intro → Demo 1 (upfront requirements, evidence upload, ranking, reasoning with the score breakdown, competitor sources, reorder, approve with a reason) → \"that was the brief\" → quote from a former Vodafone PM (used with his consent) → Demo 2 (a new PM onboards through the Project Diary, generates again, and the previous PM's decision appears in the reasoning as Decision Memory and in the score) → close.","+","+**Rebuild after app changes:** `walkthrough/tools/recapture.sh` (about 4 minutes). It runs a clean copy of the app in `/tmp` (the repo's data is never touched), records it in headless Chrome with a visible cursor, trims the AI waits, cuts one MP4 per step, and rebuilds `index.html` and `media/`. Needs Google Chrome, ffmpeg with libx264, cwebp, and `OPENAI_API_KEY` (the app calls OpenAI for requirement wording and the storyline while recording). Captions live in `tools/build.mjs`.","+","+| Tool | Does |","+| --- | --- |","+| `tools/record.mjs` | Drives the app and records it (Chrome screencast, 60 fps) |","+| `tools/encode.mjs` | Cuts the recording into one clip and end-frame still per step |","+| `tools/build.mjs` | Writes the player (`index.html`) and copies `media/` |"]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/index.html","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":293,"lines":["+<!DOCTYPE html>","+<html lang=\"en\">","+<head>","+<meta charset=\"utf-8\">","+<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">","+<title>BMW Product Intelligence · Demo walkthrough</title>","+<style>","+:root{","+  --ink:#172230;--muted:#5d6b7c;--line:#cbd5df;--bg:#f4f7fb;--panel:#ffffff;--blue:#0669d7;--blue-soft:#e8f1fc;","+  --night:#0b1a2b;--night-ink:#e9eef5;--night-muted:#9fb0c3;","+  --ease:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);--font:Inter,\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;","+}","+*{box-sizing:border-box}","+html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow:hidden}","+::selection{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}","+button{font:inherit;color:inherit}","+kbd{display:inline-block;min-width:1.6em;padding:0 .35em;border:1px solid currentColor;font:inherit;font-size:.85em;text-align:center}","+","+/* ---------- Top bar ---------- */","+.topbar{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding:0 32px;background:rgba(244,247,251,.92);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);z-index:10;backdrop-filter:saturate(1.2) blur(8px);transition:background-color .6s var(--ease),border-color .6s var(--ease),color .6s var(--ease)}","+.brand{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;white-space:nowrap}","+.brand strong{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}","+.brand span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}","+.chapters{display:flex;gap:0;margin-left:auto}","+.chapters button{position:relative;padding:22px 16px 20px;background:none;border:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;transition:color .3s}","+.chapters button::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:16px;right:16px;bottom:-1px;height:2px;background:var(--blue);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .6s var(--ease)}","+.chapters button[aria-current=\"true\"]{color:var(--ink)}","+.chapters button[aria-current=\"true\"]::after{transform:scaleX(1)}","+.chapters button:hover{color:var(--ink)}","+.counter{min-width:64px;text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}","+.progress{position:fixed;left:0;top:63px;height:2px;background:var(--blue);z-index:11;transition:width .7s var(--ease)}","+body.dark .topbar{background:rgba(11,26,43,.9);border-color:#22354b;color:var(--night-ink)}","+body.dark .brand span,body.dark .chapters button,body.dark .counter{color:var(--night-muted)}","+body.dark .chapters button[aria-current=\"true\"],body.dark .chapters button:hover{color:#fff}","+","+/* ---------- Stages ---------- */","+.stage{position:fixed;inset:64px 0 0 0;display:grid;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .7s var(--ease),visibility .7s}","+.stage.on{opacity:1;visibility:visible}","+#slide-stage{background:var(--night);color:var(--night-ink);place-items:center}","+#slide-stage.light{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}","+body.dark{background:var(--night)}","+","+/* ---------- Screenshot stage ---------- */","+#shot-stage{grid-template-rows:1fr auto;justify-items:center;padding:22px 32px 0}","+.frame{position:relative;width:min(100%,calc((100vh - 64px - 22px - 150px) * 1.6));aspect-ratio:16/10;align-self:center;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 24px 60px -24px rgba(23,34,48,.35)}","+.camera{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-origin:0 0;transition:transform 1.15s var(--ease);will-change:transform}","+.camera img,.camera video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0;user-select:none;-webkit-user-drag:none}","+.camera .on{opacity:1}","+.camera img.fade{transition:opacity .55s var(--ease)}","+.playing .hotspot{display:none}","+.frame::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:3px;width:var(--clip-progress,0%);background:var(--blue);opacity:.0;transition:opacity .3s}","+.playing.frame::after{opacity:.85}","+.hotspot{position:absolute;padding:0;border:2px solid var(--blue);background:rgba(6,105,215,.06);cursor:pointer;opacity:0;transform:scale(.92);transition:opacity .45s var(--ease),transform .45s var(--ease),left .9s var(--ease),top .9s var(--ease),width .9s var(--ease),height .9s var(--ease)}","+.hotspot.on{opacity:1;transform:none}","+.hotspot::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-2px;border:2px solid var(--blue);animation:halo 1.8s var(--ease) infinite;pointer-events:none}","+@keyframes halo{0%{opacity:.9;transform:scale(1)}100%{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.18,1.5)}}","+.hotspot .tag{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:calc(100% + 10px);transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;padding:6px 11px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;pointer-events:none}","+.hotspot .tag::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;margin-left:-6px;border:6px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--blue)}","+.hotspot.below .tag{bottom:auto;top:calc(100% + 10px)}","+.hotspot.below .tag::after{top:auto;bottom:100%;border-top-color:transparent;border-bottom-color:var(--blue)}","+.hotspot:hover,.hotspot:focus-visible{background:rgba(6,105,215,.14);outline:none}","+.hotspot:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(6,105,215,.35)}","+","+.caption{width:min(100%,calc((100vh - 64px - 22px - 150px) * 1.6));display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:22px;padding:18px 0 22px}","+.caption .num{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--blue);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}","+.caption h2{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}","+.caption p{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted);max-width:90ch}","+.caption .copy{min-width:0}","+.caption .copy>*{animation:rise .7s var(--ease) both}","+.caption .copy p{animation-delay:.08s}","+@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}","+.nav{display:flex;gap:8px}","+.nav button{height:44px;min-width:44px;padding:0 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .2s,background-color .2s,color .2s}","+.nav button:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}","+.nav button.primary{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}","+.nav button.primary:hover{background:#0553ad}","+.nav button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}","+.nav button:focus-visible,.chapters button:focus-visible,.start:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:2px}","+","+/* ---------- Slides ---------- */","+.slide{width:min(1180px,calc(100vw - 96px));padding:40px 0}","+.slide>*{animation:rise .9s var(--ease) both}","+.slide>*:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.12s}.slide>*:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.24s}.slide>*:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.36s}.slide>*:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.48s}","+.kicker-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:0 0 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--night-muted)}","+.kicker-line::before{content:'';width:36px;height:2px;background:var(--blue)}","+.display{margin:0;font-size:clamp(40px,5.2vw,74px);line-height:1.04;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-wrap:balance}","+.lede{margin:32px 0 0;font-size:clamp(18px,1.6vw,23px);line-height:1.45;color:var(--night-muted);max-width:60ch}","+.start{margin-top:40px;height:56px;padding:0 28px;border:0;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .2s,transform .2s var(--ease)}","+.start:hover{background:#0553ad}.start:active{transform:translateY(1px)}","+.scope-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;margin:44px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid #2a4058}","+.scope-list li{padding:20px 18px 0 0;font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,21px);line-height:1.35;color:var(--night-ink);opacity:0;animation:rise .8s var(--ease) both}","+.scope-list li:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.35s}.scope-list li:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.47s}.scope-list li:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.59s}.scope-list li:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.71s}","+.scope-list span{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--blue)}","+.quote{position:relative;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,52px);line-height:1.22;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-wrap:balance;quotes:'\\201C' '\\201D'}","+.quote::before{content:open-quote;position:absolute;left:-.55em;top:-.05em;color:var(--blue)}","+.quote::after{content:close-quote;color:var(--blue)}","+.quote span{display:inline-block;opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(6px);animation:word .6s var(--ease) forwards;animation-delay:calc(.25s + var(--i) * .055s)}","+@keyframes word{to{opacity:1;filter:none;transform:none}}","+.attribution{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin:40px 0 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #2a4058;animation-delay:2.2s!important}","+.attribution strong{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}","+.attribution span{font-size:15px;color:var(--night-muted)}","+.pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px;margin:44px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid #2a4058}","+.pillars strong{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}","+.pillars span{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--night-muted)}","+.hint{position:fixed;right:32px;bottom:22px;font-size:13px;color:var(--night-muted);z-index:5;transition:opacity .4s}","+body:not(.dark) .hint{opacity:0}","+","+@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;animation-delay:0s!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}}","+</style>","+</head>","+<body>","+<header class=\"topbar\">","+  <div class=\"brand\"><strong>Product Intelligence</strong><span>BMW · Demo walkthrough</span></div>","+  <nav class=\"chapters\" aria-label=\"Chapters\"><button type=\"button\" data-chapter=\"intro\">Intro</button><button type=\"button\" data-chapter=\"demo1\">Demo 1 · The brief</button><button type=\"button\" data-chapter=\"gap\">What PMs told us</button><button type=\"button\" data-chapter=\"demo2\">Demo 2 · Memory</button><button type=\"button\" data-chapter=\"close\">Close</button></nav>","+  <div class=\"counter\" id=\"counter\"></div>","+</header>","+<div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>","+","+<main>","+  <section class=\"stage\" id=\"slide-stage\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"slide\" id=\"slide\"></div></section>","+  <section class=\"stage\" id=\"shot-stage\">","+    <div class=\"frame\" id=\"frame\">","+      <div class=\"camera\" id=\"camera\">","+        <img id=\"still\" alt=\"\">","+        <video id=\"vid-a\" muted playsinline preload=\"auto\"></video><video id=\"vid-b\" muted playsinline preload=\"auto\"></video>","+        <button class=\"hotspot\" id=\"hotspot\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tag\" id=\"tag\"></span></button>","+      </div>","+    </div>","+    <div class=\"caption\">","+      <span class=\"num\" id=\"num\"></span>","+      <div class=\"copy\" id=\"copy\"></div>","+      <div class=\"nav\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"back\" aria-label=\"Previous step\">←</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"next\" class=\"primary\">Next →</button></div>","+    </div>","+  </section>","+</main>","+<p class=\"hint\">Press <kbd>→</kbd> to continue · <kbd>F</kbd> full screen</p>","+","+<script>","+const STEPS = [{\"type\":\"slide\",\"chapter\":\"intro\",\"kind\":\"title\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"kicker-line\\\">BMW Product Intelligence</p><h1 class=\\\"display\\\">From thousands of customer voices<br>to requirements a PM can defend.</h1><p class=\\\"lede\\\">A recorded, clickable walkthrough of the live demo. Click the highlighted control, or press <kbd>→</kbd>.</p><button class=\\\"start\\\" data-next>Start the demo <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">→</span></button>\"},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Set the upfront requirements\",\"text\":\"Vehicle, market, time to market, team size and how much the deadline matters. Every ranking is filtered and weighted against this.\",\"label\":\"Add evidence\",\"clip\":\"media/01-01-setup.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/01-01-setup.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.048328993055555554,\"y\":0.7084027777777778,\"w\":0.1510525173611111,\"h\":0.17463541666666665},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Add your own evidence\",\"text\":\"Customer feedback, market data, global trends or past decisions. Here: a customer-feedback CSV, weighted the same as BMW data.\",\"label\":\"Preview rows\",\"clip\":\"media/02-02-evidence.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/02-02-evidence.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.8084743923611111,\"y\":0.6422048611111111,\"w\":0.11986762152777777,\"h\":0.05814236111111111},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Check it before it counts\",\"text\":\"Every row is matched to an existing feature. The PM corrects anything wrong before it enters the knowledge base.\",\"label\":\"Add 8 rows\",\"clip\":\"media/03-03-preview.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/03-03-preview.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.7070638020833333,\"y\":0.80046875,\"w\":0.24460720486111112,\"h\":0.05814236111111111},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Generate\",\"text\":\"BMW 5 Series, United States, 18 months, 12 people, deadline 8/10, plus 8 rows of our own evidence.\",\"label\":\"Generate requirements\",\"clip\":\"media/04-04-generate.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/04-04-generate.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.6516710069444445,\"y\":0.6202604166666666,\"w\":0.3,\"h\":0.07465277777777778},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Ranked requirements per vehicle domain\",\"text\":\"Interior & Comfort. Seating comfort sits at #2, behind the audio settings.\",\"label\":\"Evidence & reasoning\",\"clip\":\"media/05-05-requirements.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/05-05-requirements.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.3024848090277778,\"y\":0.7108333333333333,\"w\":0.10469835069444444,\"h\":0.021267361111111112},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Reasoning anyone can check\",\"text\":\"Why it exists, why #2, what our upload added, and what makes up the score: customer demand, timeline fit, market evidence and competitor data. No past decisions yet.\",\"label\":\"View cited sources\",\"clip\":\"media/06-06-reasoning.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/06-06-reasoning.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.3224826388888889,\"y\":0.9217708333333333,\"w\":0.09088541666666666,\"h\":0.025121527777777777},\"focus\":{\"x\":0.3024848090277778,\"y\":0.3069791666666667,\"w\":0.6458550347222223,\"h\":0.6612326388888888}},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Every claim has a source, competitors included\",\"text\":\"Nine competitor signals from the workbook: Mercedes E-Class and Audi A6 reports and equipment lists, each linked to its row and original source.\",\"label\":\"\",\"clip\":\"media/07-06b-competitors.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/07-06b-competitors.webp\",\"hotspot\":null,\"focus\":{\"x\":0.4340277777777778,\"y\":0.00024305555555555555,\"w\":0.5326388888888889,\"h\":0.7989756944444445}},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Back to the ranking\",\"text\":\"The PM has seen the evidence. Now they decide.\",\"label\":\"Move up\",\"clip\":\"media/08-06c-move-up.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/08-06c-move-up.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.7076171875,\"y\":0.9217708333333333,\"w\":0.04235026041666667,\"h\":0.025121527777777777},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"The PM decides the order\",\"text\":\"Seating comfort moves to #1. The AI proposes; the PM decides.\",\"label\":\"Approve\",\"clip\":\"media/09-07-moved.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/09-07-moved.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.8625217013888888,\"y\":0.3097048611111111,\"w\":0.03166232638888889,\"h\":0.050659722222222224},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Say why, out loud\",\"text\":\"The PM dictates the reason; it is transcribed live and saved with the decision in Decision Memory.\",\"label\":\"Approve requirement\",\"clip\":\"media/10-08-approve.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/10-08-approve.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.7040907118055556,\"y\":0.82578125,\"w\":0.24688585069444444,\"h\":0.055989583333333336},\"focus\":{\"x\":0.4340277777777778,\"y\":0.4609027777777778,\"w\":0.5326388888888889,\"h\":0.4459722222222222}},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo1\",\"title\":\"Approved, with its reason\",\"text\":\"This is what the challenge asked for.\",\"label\":\"\",\"clip\":\"media/11-09-approved.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/11-09-approved.webp\",\"hotspot\":null,\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"slide\",\"chapter\":\"gap\",\"kind\":\"scope\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"kicker-line\\\">The challenge</p><h2 class=\\\"display\\\">That was the brief.<br>And what every team built.</h2><ol class=\\\"scope-list\\\"><li><span>01</span>Upfront requirements</li><li><span>02</span>Evidence in</li><li><span>03</span>Ranked requirements with reasoning</li><li><span>04</span>PM decides</li></ol><p class=\\\"lede\\\">So we went back and talked to product managers.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"slide\",\"chapter\":\"gap\",\"kind\":\"quote\",\"html\":\"<blockquote class=\\\"quote\\\"><span style=\\\"--i:0\\\">When</span> <span style=\\\"--i:1\\\">I</span> <span style=\\\"--i:2\\\">join</span> <span style=\\\"--i:3\\\">a</span> <span style=\\\"--i:4\\\">project</span> <span style=\\\"--i:5\\\">during</span> <span style=\\\"--i:6\\\">a</span> <span style=\\\"--i:7\\\">handover,</span> <span style=\\\"--i:8\\\">I</span> <span style=\\\"--i:9\\\">have</span> <span style=\\\"--i:10\\\">zero</span> <span style=\\\"--i:11\\\">context</span> <span style=\\\"--i:12\\\">on</span> <span style=\\\"--i:13\\\">what</span> <span style=\\\"--i:14\\\">was</span> <span style=\\\"--i:15\\\">decided</span> <span style=\\\"--i:16\\\">before,</span> <span style=\\\"--i:17\\\">or</span> <span style=\\\"--i:18\\\">why.</span> <span style=\\\"--i:19\\\">I’d</span> <span style=\\\"--i:20\\\">love</span> <span style=\\\"--i:21\\\">to</span> <span style=\\\"--i:22\\\">see</span> <span style=\\\"--i:23\\\">the</span> <span style=\\\"--i:24\\\">project’s</span> <span style=\\\"--i:25\\\">past</span> <span style=\\\"--i:26\\\">decisions</span> <span style=\\\"--i:27\\\">and</span> <span style=\\\"--i:28\\\">the</span> <span style=\\\"--i:29\\\">reasons</span> <span style=\\\"--i:30\\\">behind</span> <span style=\\\"--i:31\\\">them.</span></blockquote><p class=\\\"attribution\\\"><strong>Former Product Manager, Vodafone</strong><span>Quoted with his consent</span></p>\"},{\"type\":\"slide\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"kind\":\"divider\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"kicker-line\\\">Demo 2 · Six months later</p><h2 class=\\\"display\\\">A handover.<br>The new PM starts with the memory, not from zero.</h2>\"},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"October: a new PM joins the project\",\"text\":\"Day one: the Project Diary shows every change and decision on this vehicle, including the April decisions of the previous PM.\",\"label\":\"Storyline\",\"clip\":\"media/12-10-diary.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/12-10-diary.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.03166232638888889,\"y\":0.8775868055555556,\"w\":0.23333333333333334,\"h\":0.05333333333333334},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"Pick the onboarding storyline\",\"text\":\"From the first recorded decision to today.\",\"label\":\"Onboarding\",\"clip\":\"media/13-11-storyline-menu.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/13-11-storyline-menu.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.03235677083333333,\"y\":0.6553645833333334,\"w\":0.23194444444444445,\"h\":0.06097222222222222},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"The whole project history\",\"text\":\"Every recorded change in the range goes into the storyline.\",\"label\":\"Generate storyline\",\"clip\":\"media/14-12-storyline-range.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/14-12-storyline-range.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.5165907118055556,\"y\":0.4009201388888889,\"w\":0.12323133680555555,\"h\":0.05333333333333334},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"The project in five minutes\",\"text\":\"What was decided, in what order, and why, each linked back to the recorded event.\",\"label\":\"\",\"clip\":\"media/15-13-storyline.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/15-13-storyline.webp\",\"hotspot\":null,\"focus\":{\"x\":0.03166232638888889,\"y\":0.13300347222222222,\"w\":0.9366753472222222,\"h\":0.8393576388888889}},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"The new PM sets their own constraints\",\"text\":\"24 months, 8 people, deadline priority 5/10. Same vehicle, same market.\",\"label\":\"\",\"clip\":\"media/16-14-setup-again.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/16-14-setup-again.webp\",\"hotspot\":null,\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"Generate again\",\"text\":\"Nothing new uploaded. Decision Memory travels with the project.\",\"label\":\"Generate requirements\",\"clip\":\"media/17-14b-generate-again.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/17-14b-generate-again.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.6516710069444445,\"y\":0.6192361111111111,\"w\":0.3,\"h\":0.07465277777777778},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"Seating comfort leads, tagged Past decision\",\"text\":\"The new PM sees immediately that this requirement already has history.\",\"label\":\"Evidence & reasoning\",\"clip\":\"media/18-15-requirements-again.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/18-15-requirements-again.webp\",\"hotspot\":{\"x\":0.3024848090277778,\"y\":0.7115277777777778,\"w\":0.10469835069444444,\"h\":0.021267361111111112},\"focus\":null},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"The previous PM’s reasoning, on the requirement\",\"text\":\"Decision Memory shows who approved it, when, and why. No upload, no search: it travels with the project.\",\"label\":\"\",\"clip\":\"media/19-16-memory.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/19-16-memory.webp\",\"hotspot\":null,\"focus\":{\"x\":0.3224826388888889,\"y\":0.6207118055555556,\"w\":0.605859375,\"h\":0.16588541666666667}},{\"type\":\"shot\",\"chapter\":\"demo2\",\"title\":\"And it carries weight in the ranking\",\"text\":\"Past decisions are now part of the score, next to customer demand, timeline fit, market evidence and competitor data.\",\"label\":\"\",\"clip\":\"media/20-16b-score.mp4\",\"poster\":\"media/20-16b-score.webp\",\"hotspot\":null,\"focus\":{\"x\":0.3224826388888889,\"y\":0.6225173611111111,\"w\":0.605859375,\"h\":0.16519097222222223}},{\"type\":\"slide\",\"chapter\":\"close\",\"kind\":\"close\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"kicker-line\\\">Product Intelligence</p><h2 class=\\\"display\\\">Vehicle projects run for years.<br>PMs change. Decisions shouldn’t get lost.</h2><ul class=\\\"pillars\\\"><li><strong>Decision memory</strong><span>Every approval and rejection keeps its reason, and the reason counts in the next ranking.</span></li><li><strong>Onboarding</strong><span>A new PM reads the project’s story before the first meeting.</span></li><li><strong>Handover</strong><span>The next cycle starts where the last one left off.</span></li></ul><p class=\\\"lede\\\">We don’t replace product managers. We give them the memory of everyone who came before.</p>\"}];","+const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);","+let index = -1, zoomTimer = 0, hotspotTimer = 0, playing = null;","+const videos = [$('vid-a'), $('vid-b')];","+let active = 0;","+","+const escapeHtml = value => String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '\"': '&quot;', \"'\": '&#39;' }[c]));","+const shotNumber = i => STEPS.slice(0, i + 1).filter(step => step.type === 'shot' && step.chapter === STEPS[i].chapter).length;","+const shotTotal = chapter => STEPS.filter(step => step.type === 'shot' && step.chapter === chapter).length;","+const nextShot = from => STEPS.slice(from + 1).find(step => step.type === 'shot');","+","+// Camera: zoom so the focus box fills the frame, clamped to the recording's edges.","+function cameraFor(focus) {","+  if (!focus) return { s: 1, tx: 0, ty: 0 };","+  const pad = 0.04, s = Math.max(1, Math.min(2.4, 1 / (focus.w + pad * 2), 1 / (focus.h + pad * 2)));","+  const clamp = (v, min, max) => Math.min(max, Math.max(min, v));","+  const tx = clamp(0.5 - (focus.x + focus.w / 2) * s, 1 - s, 0), ty = clamp(0.5 - (focus.y + focus.h / 2) * s, 1 - s, 0);","+  return { s, tx, ty };","+}","+const applyCamera = cam => { $('camera').style.transform = 'translate(' + cam.tx * 100 + '%,' + cam.ty * 100 + '%) scale(' + cam.s + ')'; };","+const visibleUnder = (box, cam) => {","+  const x = box.x * cam.s + cam.tx, y = box.y * cam.s + cam.ty;","+  return x >= 0 && y >= 0 && x + box.w * cam.s <= 1 && y + box.h * cam.s <= 1;","+};","+","+function placeHotspot(step, cam) {","+  const spot = $('hotspot');","+  spot.classList.remove('on');","+  if (!step.hotspot || !visibleUnder(step.hotspot, cam)) { spot.hidden = true; return; }","+  const h = step.hotspot;","+  spot.hidden = false;","+  Object.assign(spot.style, { left: h.x * 100 + '%', top: h.y * 100 + '%', width: h.w * 100 + '%', height: h.h * 100 + '%' });","+  spot.classList.toggle('below', h.y < 0.16);","+  spot.setAttribute('aria-label', step.label);","+  $('tag').textContent = step.label;","+  // Counter-scale the label so it stays readable when the camera zooms in.","+  $('tag').style.transform = 'translateX(-50%) scale(' + 1 / cam.s + ')';","+  $('tag').style.transformOrigin = h.y < 0.16 ? '50% 0' : '50% 100%';","+  hotspotTimer = setTimeout(() => spot.classList.add('on'), cam.s > 1 ? 900 : 250);","+}","+","+// End state of a step: its last frame, zoom, hotspot.","+function settle(step, animateZoom) {","+  playing = null;","+  $('frame').classList.remove('playing');","+  $('frame').style.setProperty('--clip-progress', '0%');","+  const cam = cameraFor(step.focus);","+  clearTimeout(zoomTimer);","+  if (animateZoom) zoomTimer = setTimeout(() => applyCamera(cam), 120); else applyCamera(cam);","+  placeHotspot(step, cam);","+  $('next').textContent = step.hotspot && !$('hotspot').hidden ? 'Skip →' : 'Next →';","+  preload(index);","+}","+","+function showStill(step) {","+  const still = $('still');","+  still.classList.remove('fade');","+  still.src = step.poster;","+  still.classList.add('on');","+  videos.forEach(v => { v.pause(); v.classList.remove('on'); });","+}","+","+// Keep the next clip buffered in the idle video element.","+function preload(from) {","+  const upcoming = nextShot(from);","+  const idle = videos[1 - active];","+  if (upcoming && !idle.src.endsWith(upcoming.clip)) { idle.src = upcoming.clip; idle.load(); }","+}","+","+function playClip(step) {","+  const video = videos.find(v => v.src.endsWith(step.clip)) || videos[1 - active];","+  if (!video.src.endsWith(step.clip)) { video.src = step.clip; video.load(); }","+  active = videos.indexOf(video);","+  playing = step;","+  $('frame').classList.add('playing');","+  $('next').textContent = 'Skip clip ⇥';","+  applyCamera({ s: 1, tx: 0, ty: 0 });","+  video.currentTime = 0;","+  const start = () => {","+    if (playing !== step) return;","+    video.classList.add('on');","+    // The clip opens on the previous end frame, so hiding the still is seamless.","+    requestAnimationFrame(() => { $('still').classList.remove('on'); videos.forEach(v => v !== video && v.classList.remove('on')); });","+  };","+  video.onplaying = start;","+  video.ontimeupdate = () => { if (video.duration) $('frame').style.setProperty('--clip-progress', (video.currentTime / video.duration * 100) + '%'); };","+  video.onended = () => { if (playing !== step) return; showStill(step); settle(step, true); };","+  video.play().catch(() => { showStill(step); settle(step, false); });","+}","+","+function skipClip() {","+  if (!playing) return;","+  const step = playing;","+  videos.forEach(v => { v.onended = null; v.pause(); });","+  showStill(step);","+  settle(step, true);","+}","+","+function showShot(step, previous, direction) {","+  $('slide-stage').classList.remove('on');","+  $('shot-stage').classList.add('on');","+  document.body.classList.remove('dark');","+  clearTimeout(zoomTimer); clearTimeout(hotspotTimer);","+  $('hotspot').classList.remove('on');","+  $('num').textContent = String(shotNumber(index)).padStart(2, '0') + ' / ' + String(shotTotal(step.chapter)).padStart(2, '0');","+  $('copy').innerHTML = '<h2>' + escapeHtml(step.title) + '</h2><p>' + escapeHtml(step.text) + '</p>';","+  // Moving forward one step plays the recording; anything else jumps straight to the end state.","+  if (direction === 1 && previous >= 0 && STEPS.indexOf(nextShot(previous)) === index) playClip(step);","+  else { showStill(step); settle(step, false); }","+}","+","+function showSlide(step) {","+  playing = null;","+  videos.forEach(v => v.pause());","+  $('shot-stage').classList.remove('on');","+  $('slide-stage').classList.add('on');","+  document.body.classList.add('dark');","+  $('slide').innerHTML = step.html;","+  $('slide').querySelector('[data-next]')?.addEventListener('click', () => go(index + 1));","+  preload(index);","+}","+","+function go(target, direction = 1) {","+  if (target < 0 || target >= STEPS.length || target === index) return;","+  const previous = index;","+  index = target;","+  const step = STEPS[index];","+  if (step.type === 'shot') showShot(step, previous, Math.abs(target - previous) === 1 ? direction : 0);","+  else showSlide(step);","+  $('counter').textContent = (index + 1) + ' / ' + STEPS.length;","+  $('progress').style.width = ((index + 1) / STEPS.length * 100) + '%';","+  document.querySelectorAll('[data-chapter]').forEach(button => button.setAttribute('aria-current', String(button.dataset.chapter === step.chapter)));","+  $('back').disabled = index === 0;","+  $('next').disabled = index === STEPS.length - 1;","+  history.replaceState(null, '', '#' + (index + 1));","+}","+","+const advance = () => (playing ? skipClip() : go(index + 1));","+$('hotspot').addEventListener('click', () => go(index + 1));","+$('next').addEventListener('click', advance);","+$('back').addEventListener('click', () => go(index - 1, -1));","+document.querySelectorAll('[data-chapter]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => go(STEPS.findIndex(step => step.chapter === button.dataset.chapter), 0)));","+document.addEventListener('keydown', event => {","+  if (event.metaKey || event.ctrlKey || event.altKey) return;","+  if (['ArrowRight', 'PageDown', ' ', 'Enter'].includes(event.key)) { event.preventDefault(); advance(); }","+  else if (['ArrowLeft', 'PageUp'].includes(event.key)) { event.preventDefault(); go(index - 1, -1); }","+  else if (event.key === 'Home') go(0, 0);","+  else if (event.key === 'End') go(STEPS.length - 1, 0);","+  else if (event.key.toLowerCase() === 'f') document.fullscreenElement ? document.exitFullscreen() : document.documentElement.requestFullscreen?.();","+});","+","+go(Math.min(STEPS.length, Math.max(1, Number(location.hash.slice(1)) || 1)) - 1, 0);","+</script>","+</body>","+</html>"]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/tools/build.mjs","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":351,"lines":["+// Builds walkthrough/index.html: an offline, clickable demo walkthrough that plays one screen-recorded","+// clip per step (from record.mjs + encode.mjs) and pauses on hotspots the presenter clicks.","+// Usage: node build.mjs <media-dir-with-manifest.json> <out-dir>","+import { cpSync, readFileSync, rmSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';","+import { join } from 'node:path';","+","+const [MEDIA = '/tmp/walkthrough-capture/media', OUT_DIR] = process.argv.slice(2);","+const recorded = Object.fromEntries(JSON.parse(readFileSync(join(MEDIA, 'manifest.json'), 'utf8')).map(step => [step.name, step]));","+rmSync(join(OUT_DIR, 'media'), { recursive: true, force: true });","+cpSync(MEDIA, join(OUT_DIR, 'media'), { recursive: true, filter: source => !source.endsWith('manifest.json') });","+","+// Presenter copy per captured step. `label` names the click; `zoom` uses the recorded focus box.","+const SHOT_COPY = {","+  '01-setup': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Set the upfront requirements', text: 'Vehicle, market, time to market, team size and how much the deadline matters. Every ranking is filtered and weighted against this.', label: 'Add evidence' },","+  '02-evidence': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Add your own evidence', text: 'Customer feedback, market data, global trends or past decisions. Here: a customer-feedback CSV, weighted the same as BMW data.', label: 'Preview rows' },","+  '03-preview': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Check it before it counts', text: 'Every row is matched to an existing feature. The PM corrects anything wrong before it enters the knowledge base.', label: 'Add 8 rows' },","+  '04-generate': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Generate', text: 'BMW 5 Series, United States, 18 months, 12 people, deadline 8/10, plus 8 rows of our own evidence.', label: 'Generate requirements' },","+  '05-requirements': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Ranked requirements per vehicle domain', text: 'Interior & Comfort. Seating comfort sits at #2, behind the audio settings.', label: 'Evidence & reasoning' },","+  '06-reasoning': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Reasoning anyone can check', text: 'Why it exists, why #2, what our upload added, and what makes up the score: customer demand, timeline fit, market evidence and competitor data. No past decisions yet.', label: 'View cited sources', zoom: true },","+  '06b-competitors': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Every claim has a source, competitors included', text: 'Nine competitor signals from the workbook: Mercedes E-Class and Audi A6 reports and equipment lists, each linked to its row and original source.', zoom: true },","+  '06c-move-up': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Back to the ranking', text: 'The PM has seen the evidence. Now they decide.', label: 'Move up' },","+  '07-moved': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'The PM decides the order', text: 'Seating comfort moves to #1. The AI proposes; the PM decides.', label: 'Approve' },","+  '08-approve': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Say why, out loud', text: 'The PM dictates the reason; it is transcribed live and saved with the decision in Decision Memory.', label: 'Approve requirement', zoom: true },","+  '09-approved': { chapter: 'demo1', title: 'Approved, with its reason', text: 'This is what the challenge asked for.' },","+  '10-diary': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'October: a new PM joins the project', text: 'Day one: the Project Diary shows every change and decision on this vehicle, including the April decisions of the previous PM.', label: 'Storyline' },","+  '11-storyline-menu': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'Pick the onboarding storyline', text: 'From the first recorded decision to today.', label: 'Onboarding' },","+  '12-storyline-range': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'The whole project history', text: 'Every recorded change in the range goes into the storyline.', label: 'Generate storyline' },","+  '13-storyline': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'The project in five minutes', text: 'What was decided, in what order, and why, each linked back to the recorded event.', zoom: true },","+  '14-setup-again': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'The new PM sets their own constraints', text: '24 months, 8 people, deadline priority 5/10. Same vehicle, same market.' },","+  '14b-generate-again': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'Generate again', text: 'Nothing new uploaded. Decision Memory travels with the project.', label: 'Generate requirements' },","+  '15-requirements-again': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'Seating comfort leads, tagged Past decision', text: 'The new PM sees immediately that this requirement already has history.', label: 'Evidence & reasoning' },","+  '16-memory': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'The previous PM’s reasoning, on the requirement', text: 'Decision Memory shows who approved it, when, and why. No upload, no search: it travels with the project.', zoom: true },","+  '16b-score': { chapter: 'demo2', title: 'And it carries weight in the ranking', text: 'Past decisions are now part of the score, next to customer demand, timeline fit, market evidence and competitor data.', zoom: true }","+};","+","+const QUOTE = 'When I join a project during a handover, I have zero context on what was decided before, or why. I’d love to see the project’s past decisions and the reasons behind them.';","+","+const steps = [","+  { type: 'slide', chapter: 'intro', kind: 'title', html: `<p class=\"kicker-line\">BMW Product Intelligence</p><h1 class=\"display\">From thousands of customer voices<br>to requirements a PM can defend.</h1><p class=\"lede\">A recorded, clickable walkthrough of the live demo. Click the highlighted control, or press <kbd>→</kbd>.</p><button class=\"start\" data-next>Start the demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button>` },","+  ...['01-setup', '02-evidence', '03-preview', '04-generate', '05-requirements', '06-reasoning', '06b-competitors', '06c-move-up', '07-moved', '08-approve', '09-approved'].map(name => ({ type: 'shot', name })),","+  { type: 'slide', chapter: 'gap', kind: 'scope', html: `<p class=\"kicker-line\">The challenge</p><h2 class=\"display\">That was the brief.<br>And what every team built.</h2><ol class=\"scope-list\"><li><span>01</span>Upfront requirements</li><li><span>02</span>Evidence in</li><li><span>03</span>Ranked requirements with reasoning</li><li><span>04</span>PM decides</li></ol><p class=\"lede\">So we went back and talked to product managers.</p>` },","+  { type: 'slide', chapter: 'gap', kind: 'quote', html: `<blockquote class=\"quote\">${QUOTE.split(' ').map((word, i) => `<span style=\"--i:${i}\">${word}</span>`).join(' ')}</blockquote><p class=\"attribution\"><strong>Former Product Manager, Vodafone</strong><span>Quoted with his consent</span></p>` },","+  { type: 'slide', chapter: 'demo2', kind: 'divider', html: `<p class=\"kicker-line\">Demo 2 · Six months later</p><h2 class=\"display\">A handover.<br>The new PM starts with the memory, not from zero.</h2>` },","+  ...['10-diary', '11-storyline-menu', '12-storyline-range', '13-storyline', '14-setup-again', '14b-generate-again', '15-requirements-again', '16-memory', '16b-score'].map(name => ({ type: 'shot', name })),","+  { type: 'slide', chapter: 'close', kind: 'close', html: `<p class=\"kicker-line\">Product Intelligence</p><h2 class=\"display\">Vehicle projects run for years.<br>PMs change. Decisions shouldn’t get lost.</h2><ul class=\"pillars\"><li><strong>Decision memory</strong><span>Every approval and rejection keeps its reason, and the reason counts in the next ranking.</span></li><li><strong>Onboarding</strong><span>A new PM reads the project’s story before the first meeting.</span></li><li><strong>Handover</strong><span>The next cycle starts where the last one left off.</span></li></ul><p class=\"lede\">We don’t replace product managers. We give them the memory of everyone who came before.</p>` }","+].map(step => {","+  if (step.type !== 'shot') return step;","+  const rec = recorded[step.name], copy = SHOT_COPY[step.name];","+  if (!rec) throw new Error(`Missing capture for ${step.name}`);","+  return { type: 'shot', chapter: copy.chapter, title: copy.title, text: copy.text, label: copy.label || '', clip: `media/${rec.clip}`, poster: `media/${rec.poster}`, hotspot: copy.label ? rec.hotspot : null, focus: copy.zoom ? rec.focus : null };","+});","+","+const CHAPTERS = [['intro', 'Intro'], ['demo1', 'Demo 1 · The brief'], ['gap', 'What PMs told us'], ['demo2', 'Demo 2 · Memory'], ['close', 'Close']];","+","+const html = `<!DOCTYPE html>","+<html lang=\"en\">","+<head>","+<meta charset=\"utf-8\">","+<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">","+<title>BMW Product Intelligence · Demo walkthrough</title>","+<style>","+:root{","+  --ink:#172230;--muted:#5d6b7c;--line:#cbd5df;--bg:#f4f7fb;--panel:#ffffff;--blue:#0669d7;--blue-soft:#e8f1fc;","+  --night:#0b1a2b;--night-ink:#e9eef5;--night-muted:#9fb0c3;","+  --ease:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);--font:Inter,\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;","+}","+*{box-sizing:border-box}","+html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow:hidden}","+::selection{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}","+button{font:inherit;color:inherit}","+kbd{display:inline-block;min-width:1.6em;padding:0 .35em;border:1px solid currentColor;font:inherit;font-size:.85em;text-align:center}","+","+/* ---------- Top bar ---------- */","+.topbar{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding:0 32px;background:rgba(244,247,251,.92);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);z-index:10;backdrop-filter:saturate(1.2) blur(8px);transition:background-color .6s var(--ease),border-color .6s var(--ease),color .6s var(--ease)}","+.brand{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;white-space:nowrap}","+.brand strong{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}","+.brand span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}","+.chapters{display:flex;gap:0;margin-left:auto}","+.chapters button{position:relative;padding:22px 16px 20px;background:none;border:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;transition:color .3s}","+.chapters button::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:16px;right:16px;bottom:-1px;height:2px;background:var(--blue);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .6s var(--ease)}","+.chapters button[aria-current=\"true\"]{color:var(--ink)}","+.chapters button[aria-current=\"true\"]::after{transform:scaleX(1)}","+.chapters button:hover{color:var(--ink)}","+.counter{min-width:64px;text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}","+.progress{position:fixed;left:0;top:63px;height:2px;background:var(--blue);z-index:11;transition:width .7s var(--ease)}","+body.dark .topbar{background:rgba(11,26,43,.9);border-color:#22354b;color:var(--night-ink)}","+body.dark .brand span,body.dark .chapters button,body.dark .counter{color:var(--night-muted)}","+body.dark .chapters button[aria-current=\"true\"],body.dark .chapters button:hover{color:#fff}","+","+/* ---------- Stages ---------- */","+.stage{position:fixed;inset:64px 0 0 0;display:grid;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .7s var(--ease),visibility .7s}","+.stage.on{opacity:1;visibility:visible}","+#slide-stage{background:var(--night);color:var(--night-ink);place-items:center}","+#slide-stage.light{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}","+body.dark{background:var(--night)}","+","+/* ---------- Screenshot stage ---------- */","+#shot-stage{grid-template-rows:1fr auto;justify-items:center;padding:22px 32px 0}","+.frame{position:relative;width:min(100%,calc((100vh - 64px - 22px - 150px) * 1.6));aspect-ratio:16/10;align-self:center;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 24px 60px -24px rgba(23,34,48,.35)}","+.camera{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-origin:0 0;transition:transform 1.15s var(--ease);will-change:transform}","+.camera img,.camera video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0;user-select:none;-webkit-user-drag:none}","+.camera .on{opacity:1}","+.camera img.fade{transition:opacity .55s var(--ease)}","+.playing .hotspot{display:none}","+.frame::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:3px;width:var(--clip-progress,0%);background:var(--blue);opacity:.0;transition:opacity .3s}","+.playing.frame::after{opacity:.85}","+.hotspot{position:absolute;padding:0;border:2px solid var(--blue);background:rgba(6,105,215,.06);cursor:pointer;opacity:0;transform:scale(.92);transition:opacity .45s var(--ease),transform .45s var(--ease),left .9s var(--ease),top .9s var(--ease),width .9s var(--ease),height .9s var(--ease)}","+.hotspot.on{opacity:1;transform:none}","+.hotspot::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-2px;border:2px solid var(--blue);animation:halo 1.8s var(--ease) infinite;pointer-events:none}","+@keyframes halo{0%{opacity:.9;transform:scale(1)}100%{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.18,1.5)}}","+.hotspot .tag{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:calc(100% + 10px);transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;padding:6px 11px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;pointer-events:none}","+.hotspot .tag::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;margin-left:-6px;border:6px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--blue)}","+.hotspot.below .tag{bottom:auto;top:calc(100% + 10px)}","+.hotspot.below .tag::after{top:auto;bottom:100%;border-top-color:transparent;border-bottom-color:var(--blue)}","+.hotspot:hover,.hotspot:focus-visible{background:rgba(6,105,215,.14);outline:none}","+.hotspot:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(6,105,215,.35)}","+","+.caption{width:min(100%,calc((100vh - 64px - 22px - 150px) * 1.6));display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:22px;padding:18px 0 22px}","+.caption .num{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--blue);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}","+.caption h2{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}","+.caption p{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted);max-width:90ch}","+.caption .copy{min-width:0}","+.caption .copy>*{animation:rise .7s var(--ease) both}","+.caption .copy p{animation-delay:.08s}","+@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}","+.nav{display:flex;gap:8px}","+.nav button{height:44px;min-width:44px;padding:0 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .2s,background-color .2s,color .2s}","+.nav button:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}","+.nav button.primary{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}","+.nav button.primary:hover{background:#0553ad}","+.nav button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}","+.nav button:focus-visible,.chapters button:focus-visible,.start:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:2px}","+","+/* ---------- Slides ---------- */","+.slide{width:min(1180px,calc(100vw - 96px));padding:40px 0}","+.slide>*{animation:rise .9s var(--ease) both}","+.slide>*:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.12s}.slide>*:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.24s}.slide>*:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.36s}.slide>*:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.48s}","+.kicker-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:0 0 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--night-muted)}","+.kicker-line::before{content:'';width:36px;height:2px;background:var(--blue)}","+.display{margin:0;font-size:clamp(40px,5.2vw,74px);line-height:1.04;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-wrap:balance}","+.lede{margin:32px 0 0;font-size:clamp(18px,1.6vw,23px);line-height:1.45;color:var(--night-muted);max-width:60ch}","+.start{margin-top:40px;height:56px;padding:0 28px;border:0;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .2s,transform .2s var(--ease)}","+.start:hover{background:#0553ad}.start:active{transform:translateY(1px)}","+.scope-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;margin:44px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid #2a4058}","+.scope-list li{padding:20px 18px 0 0;font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,21px);line-height:1.35;color:var(--night-ink);opacity:0;animation:rise .8s var(--ease) both}","+.scope-list li:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.35s}.scope-list li:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.47s}.scope-list li:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.59s}.scope-list li:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.71s}","+.scope-list span{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--blue)}","+.quote{position:relative;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,52px);line-height:1.22;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-wrap:balance;quotes:'\\\\201C' '\\\\201D'}","+.quote::before{content:open-quote;position:absolute;left:-.55em;top:-.05em;color:var(--blue)}","+.quote::after{content:close-quote;color:var(--blue)}","+.quote span{display:inline-block;opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(6px);animation:word .6s var(--ease) forwards;animation-delay:calc(.25s + var(--i) * .055s)}","+@keyframes word{to{opacity:1;filter:none;transform:none}}","+.attribution{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin:40px 0 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #2a4058;animation-delay:2.2s!important}","+.attribution strong{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}","+.attribution span{font-size:15px;color:var(--night-muted)}","+.pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px;margin:44px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid #2a4058}","+.pillars strong{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}","+.pillars span{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--night-muted)}","+.hint{position:fixed;right:32px;bottom:22px;font-size:13px;color:var(--night-muted);z-index:5;transition:opacity .4s}","+body:not(.dark) .hint{opacity:0}","+","+@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;animation-delay:0s!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}}","+</style>","+</head>","+<body>","+<header class=\"topbar\">","+  <div class=\"brand\"><strong>Product Intelligence</strong><span>BMW · Demo walkthrough</span></div>","+  <nav class=\"chapters\" aria-label=\"Chapters\">${CHAPTERS.map(([key, label]) => `<button type=\"button\" data-chapter=\"${key}\">${label}</button>`).join('')}</nav>","+  <div class=\"counter\" id=\"counter\"></div>","+</header>","+<div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>","+","+<main>","+  <section class=\"stage\" id=\"slide-stage\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"slide\" id=\"slide\"></div></section>","+  <section class=\"stage\" id=\"shot-stage\">","+    <div class=\"frame\" id=\"frame\">","+      <div class=\"camera\" id=\"camera\">","+        <img id=\"still\" alt=\"\">","+        <video id=\"vid-a\" muted playsinline preload=\"auto\"></video><video id=\"vid-b\" muted playsinline preload=\"auto\"></video>","+        <button class=\"hotspot\" id=\"hotspot\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"tag\" id=\"tag\"></span></button>","+      </div>","+    </div>","+    <div class=\"caption\">","+      <span class=\"num\" id=\"num\"></span>","+      <div class=\"copy\" id=\"copy\"></div>","+      <div class=\"nav\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"back\" aria-label=\"Previous step\">←</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"next\" class=\"primary\">Next →</button></div>","+    </div>","+  </section>","+</main>","+<p class=\"hint\">Press <kbd>→</kbd> to continue · <kbd>F</kbd> full screen</p>","+","+<script>","+const STEPS = ${JSON.stringify(steps)};","+const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);","+let index = -1, zoomTimer = 0, hotspotTimer = 0, playing = null;","+const videos = [$('vid-a'), $('vid-b')];","+let active = 0;","+","+const escapeHtml = value => String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '\"': '&quot;', \"'\": '&#39;' }[c]));","+const shotNumber = i => STEPS.slice(0, i + 1).filter(step => step.type === 'shot' && step.chapter === STEPS[i].chapter).length;","+const shotTotal = chapter => STEPS.filter(step => step.type === 'shot' && step.chapter === chapter).length;","+const nextShot = from => STEPS.slice(from + 1).find(step => step.type === 'shot');","+","+// Camera: zoom so the focus box fills the frame, clamped to the recording's edges.","+function cameraFor(focus) {","+  if (!focus) return { s: 1, tx: 0, ty: 0 };","+  const pad = 0.04, s = Math.max(1, Math.min(2.4, 1 / (focus.w + pad * 2), 1 / (focus.h + pad * 2)));","+  const clamp = (v, min, max) => Math.min(max, Math.max(min, v));","+  const tx = clamp(0.5 - (focus.x + focus.w / 2) * s, 1 - s, 0), ty = clamp(0.5 - (focus.y + focus.h / 2) * s, 1 - s, 0);","+  return { s, tx, ty };","+}","+const applyCamera = cam => { $('camera').style.transform = 'translate(' + cam.tx * 100 + '%,' + cam.ty * 100 + '%) scale(' + cam.s + ')'; };","+const visibleUnder = (box, cam) => {","+  const x = box.x * cam.s + cam.tx, y = box.y * cam.s + cam.ty;","+  return x >= 0 && y >= 0 && x + box.w * cam.s <= 1 && y + box.h * cam.s <= 1;","+};","+","+function placeHotspot(step, cam) {","+  const spot = $('hotspot');","+  spot.classList.remove('on');","+  if (!step.hotspot || !visibleUnder(step.hotspot, cam)) { spot.hidden = true; return; }","+  const h = step.hotspot;","+  spot.hidden = false;","+  Object.assign(spot.style, { left: h.x * 100 + '%', top: h.y * 100 + '%', width: h.w * 100 + '%', height: h.h * 100 + '%' });","+  spot.classList.toggle('below', h.y < 0.16);","+  spot.setAttribute('aria-label', step.label);","+  $('tag').textContent = step.label;","+  // Counter-scale the label so it stays readable when the camera zooms in.","+  $('tag').style.transform = 'translateX(-50%) scale(' + 1 / cam.s + ')';","+  $('tag').style.transformOrigin = h.y < 0.16 ? '50% 0' : '50% 100%';","+  hotspotTimer = setTimeout(() => spot.classList.add('on'), cam.s > 1 ? 900 : 250);","+}","+","+// End state of a step: its last frame, zoom, hotspot.","+function settle(step, animateZoom) {","+  playing = null;","+  $('frame').classList.remove('playing');","+  $('frame').style.setProperty('--clip-progress', '0%');","+  const cam = cameraFor(step.focus);","+  clearTimeout(zoomTimer);","+  if (animateZoom) zoomTimer = setTimeout(() => applyCamera(cam), 120); else applyCamera(cam);","+  placeHotspot(step, cam);","+  $('next').textContent = step.hotspot && !$('hotspot').hidden ? 'Skip →' : 'Next →';","+  preload(index);","+}","+","+function showStill(step) {","+  const still = $('still');","+  still.classList.remove('fade');","+  still.src = step.poster;","+  still.classList.add('on');","+  videos.forEach(v => { v.pause(); v.classList.remove('on'); });","+}","+","+// Keep the next clip buffered in the idle video element.","+function preload(from) {","+  const upcoming = nextShot(from);","+  const idle = videos[1 - active];","+  if (upcoming && !idle.src.endsWith(upcoming.clip)) { idle.src = upcoming.clip; idle.load(); }","+}","+","+function playClip(step) {","+  const video = videos.find(v => v.src.endsWith(step.clip)) || videos[1 - active];","+  if (!video.src.endsWith(step.clip)) { video.src = step.clip; video.load(); }","+  active = videos.indexOf(video);","+  playing = step;","+  $('frame').classList.add('playing');","+  $('next').textContent = 'Skip clip ⇥';","+  applyCamera({ s: 1, tx: 0, ty: 0 });","+  video.currentTime = 0;","+  const start = () => {","+    if (playing !== step) return;","+    video.classList.add('on');","+    // The clip opens on the previous end frame, so hiding the still is seamless.","+    requestAnimationFrame(() => { $('still').classList.remove('on'); videos.forEach(v => v !== video && v.classList.remove('on')); });","+  };","+  video.onplaying = start;","+  video.ontimeupdate = () => { if (video.duration) $('frame').style.setProperty('--clip-progress', (video.currentTime / video.duration * 100) + '%'); };","+  video.onended = () => { if (playing !== step) return; showStill(step); settle(step, true); };","+  video.play().catch(() => { showStill(step); settle(step, false); });","+}","+","+function skipClip() {","+  if (!playing) return;","+  const step = playing;","+  videos.forEach(v => { v.onended = null; v.pause(); });","+  showStill(step);","+  settle(step, true);","+}","+","+function showShot(step, previous, direction) {","+  $('slide-stage').classList.remove('on');","+  $('shot-stage').classList.add('on');","+  document.body.classList.remove('dark');","+  clearTimeout(zoomTimer); clearTimeout(hotspotTimer);","+  $('hotspot').classList.remove('on');","+  $('num').textContent = String(shotNumber(index)).padStart(2, '0') + ' / ' + String(shotTotal(step.chapter)).padStart(2, '0');","+  $('copy').innerHTML = '<h2>' + escapeHtml(step.title) + '</h2><p>' + escapeHtml(step.text) + '</p>';","+  // Moving forward one step plays the recording; anything else jumps straight to the end state.","+  if (direction === 1 && previous >= 0 && STEPS.indexOf(nextShot(previous)) === index) playClip(step);","+  else { showStill(step); settle(step, false); }","+}","+","+function showSlide(step) {","+  playing = null;","+  videos.forEach(v => v.pause());","+  $('shot-stage').classList.remove('on');","+  $('slide-stage').classList.add('on');","+  document.body.classList.add('dark');","+  $('slide').innerHTML = step.html;","+  $('slide').querySelector('[data-next]')?.addEventListener('click', () => go(index + 1));","+  preload(index);","+}","+","+function go(target, direction = 1) {","+  if (target < 0 || target >= STEPS.length || target === index) return;","+  const previous = index;","+  index = target;","+  const step = STEPS[index];","+  if (step.type === 'shot') showShot(step, previous, Math.abs(target - previous) === 1 ? direction : 0);","+  else showSlide(step);","+  $('counter').textContent = (index + 1) + ' / ' + STEPS.length;","+  $('progress').style.width = ((index + 1) / STEPS.length * 100) + '%';","+  document.querySelectorAll('[data-chapter]').forEach(button => button.setAttribute('aria-current', String(button.dataset.chapter === step.chapter)));","+  $('back').disabled = index === 0;","+  $('next').disabled = index === STEPS.length - 1;","+  history.replaceState(null, '', '#' + (index + 1));","+}","+","+const advance = () => (playing ? skipClip() : go(index + 1));","+$('hotspot').addEventListener('click', () => go(index + 1));","+$('next').addEventListener('click', advance);","+$('back').addEventListener('click', () => go(index - 1, -1));","+document.querySelectorAll('[data-chapter]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => go(STEPS.findIndex(step => step.chapter === button.dataset.chapter), 0)));","+document.addEventListener('keydown', event => {","+  if (event.metaKey || event.ctrlKey || event.altKey) return;","+  if (['ArrowRight', 'PageDown', ' ', 'Enter'].includes(event.key)) { event.preventDefault(); advance(); }","+  else if (['ArrowLeft', 'PageUp'].includes(event.key)) { event.preventDefault(); go(index - 1, -1); }","+  else if (event.key === 'Home') go(0, 0);","+  else if (event.key === 'End') go(STEPS.length - 1, 0);","+  else if (event.key.toLowerCase() === 'f') document.fullscreenElement ? document.exitFullscreen() : document.documentElement.requestFullscreen?.();","+});","+","+go(Math.min(STEPS.length, Math.max(1, Number(location.hash.slice(1)) || 1)) - 1, 0);","+</script>","+</body>","+</html>","+`;","+","+writeFileSync(join(OUT_DIR, 'index.html'), html);","+console.log(`Wrote ${join(OUT_DIR, 'index.html')} · ${steps.length} steps · media in ${join(OUT_DIR, 'media')}`);"]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/tools/encode.mjs","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":42,"lines":["+// Turns the recording from record.mjs into one MP4 clip per step (plus a still of its last frame).","+// Usage: node encode.mjs <rec-dir> <media-out-dir>","+import { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';","+import { mkdirSync, readFileSync, rmSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';","+import { join } from 'node:path';","+","+const [REC = '/tmp/walkthrough-capture/rec', MEDIA] = process.argv.slice(2);","+const timeline = JSON.parse(readFileSync(join(REC, 'timeline.json'), 'utf8'));","+rmSync(MEDIA, { recursive: true, force: true });","+mkdirSync(MEDIA, { recursive: true });","+const work = join(REC, 'lists'); rmSync(work, { recursive: true, force: true }); mkdirSync(work, { recursive: true });","+","+const cuts = timeline.cuts.sort((a, b) => a[0] - b[0]);","+const inCut = t => cuts.some(([a, b]) => t > a && t < b);","+// Position on the trimmed timeline.","+const trimmed = t => t - cuts.filter(([, b]) => b <= t).reduce((sum, [a, b]) => sum + (b - a), 0) - cuts.filter(([a, b]) => a < t && t < b).reduce((sum, [a]) => sum + (t - a), 0);","+const frames = timeline.frames.filter(frame => !inCut(frame.t)).map(frame => ({ ...frame, at: trimmed(frame.t) })).sort((a, b) => a.at - b.at);","+","+const manifest = [];","+let segmentStart = trimmed(timeline.start);","+timeline.steps.forEach((step, index) => {","+  if (step.start) segmentStart = trimmed(step.start);","+  const segmentEnd = trimmed(step.end);","+  // The segment opens on whatever was on screen at its start, then plays every frame up to its end.","+  const before = [...frames].reverse().find(frame => frame.at <= segmentStart) || frames[0];","+  const inside = frames.filter(frame => frame.at > segmentStart && frame.at <= segmentEnd);","+  const list = [{ file: before.file, at: segmentStart }, ...inside];","+  const lines = list.map((frame, i) => {","+    const next = i + 1 < list.length ? list[i + 1].at : segmentEnd + 0.05;","+    return `file '${join(REC, 'frames', frame.file)}'\\nduration ${Math.max(0.001, next - frame.at).toFixed(4)}`;","+  });","+  lines.push(`file '${join(REC, 'frames', list.at(-1).file)}'`);","+  const listFile = join(work, `${step.name}.txt`);","+  writeFileSync(listFile, lines.join('\\n') + '\\n');","+  const clip = `${String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}-${step.name}.mp4`, poster = `${String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}-${step.name}.webp`;","+  execFileSync('ffmpeg', ['-loglevel', 'error', '-y', '-f', 'concat', '-safe', '0', '-i', listFile, '-fps_mode', 'cfr', '-r', '60', '-c:v', 'libx264', '-preset', 'slow', '-crf', '23', '-pix_fmt', 'yuv420p', '-profile:v', 'high', '-movflags', '+faststart', '-an', join(MEDIA, clip)]);","+  execFileSync('cwebp', ['-quiet', '-q', '82', join(REC, 'frames', list.at(-1).file), '-o', join(MEDIA, poster)]);","+  manifest.push({ name: step.name, clip, poster, duration: +(segmentEnd - segmentStart).toFixed(2), hotspot: step.hotspot, focus: step.focus });","+  console.log(`${clip}  ${(segmentEnd - segmentStart).toFixed(1)}s  ${list.length} frames`);","+  segmentStart = segmentEnd;","+});","+writeFileSync(join(MEDIA, 'manifest.json'), JSON.stringify(manifest, null, 1));"]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":43,"changedFiles":["/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/public/app.js","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/README.md","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/index.html","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media/01-01-setup.mp4","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media/01-01-setup.webp","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media/02-02-evidence.mp4","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media/02-02-evidence.webp","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media/03-03-preview.mp4","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media/03-03-preview.webp","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL/walkthrough/media/04-04-generate.mp4","/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/F