{"parentUuid":"c4263813-a3dc-41f8-9797-a0d811ca42f3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01B72snrSdQnyrT3NSb1FprM","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"69b4a9c3-d8c3-4630-b614-66236781fe90","timestamp":"2026-10-11T09:47:11.844Z","session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feather"}
{"parentUuid":"69b4a9c3-d8c3-4630-b614-66236781fe90","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvEjqDvg5SWNgSvNpiDp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The script is in **`walkthrough/SCRIPT.md`**, with one row for each of the walkthrough's 25 steps, in order. Each row gives the timestamp, what's on screen, what to say, and what to click: the highlighted control, or → on steps without one. Not committed.\n\n**Timing:** each step is timed from its real clip length or its line at about 150 words a minute, whichever is longer. Spoken lines and clips end at **2:46**; the remaining ~14 seconds cover your clicks between steps, so the run lands just under 3:00. I computed this; I couldn't rehearse it out loud, so do one run with a timer. If you're short on time, press → during a clip to skip to its end.\n\n**The arc in brief:**\n1. **Hook (0:00):** \"Every new BMW starts with one question: what should the next one be? The answer is buried in thousands of customer voices.\"\n2. **Demo 1 (0:09–1:19):** frame, evidence, the check, generate. Then \"4,365 real customer findings become a ranked list… seat comfort is number two. Why?\" Then no black box: 88 customers and the score breakdown, nine competitor signals. \"But the AI only proposes. The PM decides.\" Move up, then dictate the reason and approve.\n3. **The turn (1:19–1:44):** \"That was the brief, and honestly, that is what every team built.\" Then the Vodafone quote with a pause to read, and \"Six months later, a new PM takes over.\"\n4. **Demo 2 (1:44–2:36):**\n   - the Project Diary and the onboarding storyline;\n   - new constraints, then \"Generate again. Nothing uploaded.\";\n   - the Past decision tag;\n   - \"approved on 14 April by the previous PM, in their own words\";\n   - \"it counts in the ranking\".\n5. **Close (2:36):** \"Projects run for years. People change. Decisions shouldn't get lost. We don't replace product managers. We give them the memory of everyone before them.\"\n\nBelow the script are four short Q&A answers you'll likely need:\n- whether the data is real;\n- that the dictation in the recording was simulated, because it was recorded without a microphone;\n- why the legend says 5 points but 9 signals;\n- what a past decision does to the score."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":523,"cache_read_input_tokens":747775,"output_tokens":736,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":523},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":736,"cache_read_input_tokens":747775,"cache_creation_input_tokens":523,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":523,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e42f1d55-85e6-4223-8b41-ef445e713cc4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfvEjpgAtCtqsDN87K3pF","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"dc4f2501-b470-4cff-9c69-4ada0069a8e9","timestamp":"2026-10-11T09:47:11.844Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feather"}
