{"parentUuid":"de7c5181-429f-45e2-acab-d9002efc5540","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d664b782-ff13-41ae-98ac-3cd37747011e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GZPDHXzHdpY8222PqpSEiL","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/.local/bin/entire\nThe command-line interface for Entire\n\nGetting Started:\n  To get started with Entire CLI, run 'entire enable' to enable\n  session tracking in your repository, then 'entire agent add <name>'\n  to install hooks for a specific agent. For more information, visit:\n  https://docs.entire.io/overview\n\n\nEnvironment Variables:\n  ACCESSIBLE    Set to any value (e.g., ACCESSIBLE=1) to enable accessibility\n                mode. This uses simpler text prompts instead of interactive\n                TUI elements, which works better with screen readers.\n\nUsage:\n  entire [flags]\n  entire [command]\n\nEntire Setup:\n  agent                      Manage agent integrations (add, remove, list)\n  clean                      Clean up Entire session data\n  configure                  Update Entire settings in the current repository\n  disable                    Disable Entire in current repository\n  doctor                     Diagnose and fix session issues\n  enable                     Enable Entire in current repository\n  plugin                     Manage Entire plugins (install, list, upgrade, search, remove)\n  status                     Show Entire status\n\nSessions & Checkpoints:\n  activity                   Show your activity overview\n  checkpoint                 Inspect and search checkpoints\n  dispatch                   Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\n  recap                      Summarize recent checkpoint activity\n  search                     Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  session                    Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\n\nAccount:\n  auth                       Manage authentication\n  login                      Log in to Entire\n  logout                     Log out of Entire\n{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"checkpoints\": {\n    \"primary\": {\n      \"type\": \"git-refs\"\n    }\n  }\n}\ntmp/\nsettings.local.json\nmetadata/\nlogs/\nredactors/local/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bdf39e76-97c1-41f2-878f-3514ac22c58f","timestamp":"2026-10-11T11:53:35.069Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/.local/bin/entire\nThe command-line interface for Entire\n\nGetting Started:\n  To get started with Entire CLI, run 'entire enable' to enable\n  session tracking in your repository, then 'entire agent add <name>'\n  to install hooks for a specific agent. For more information, visit:\n  https://docs.entire.io/overview\n\n\nEnvironment Variables:\n  ACCESSIBLE    Set to any value (e.g., ACCESSIBLE=1) to enable accessibility\n                mode. This uses simpler text prompts instead of interactive\n                TUI elements, which works better with screen readers.\n\nUsage:\n  entire [flags]\n  entire [command]\n\nEntire Setup:\n  agent                      Manage agent integrations (add, remove, list)\n  clean                      Clean up Entire session data\n  configure                  Update Entire settings in the current repository\n  disable                    Disable Entire in current repository\n  doctor                     Diagnose and fix session issues\n  enable                     Enable Entire in current repository\n  plugin                     Manage Entire plugins (install, list, upgrade, search, remove)\n  status                     Show Entire status\n\nSessions & Checkpoints:\n  activity                   Show your activity overview\n  checkpoint                 Inspect and search checkpoints\n  dispatch                   Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\n  recap                      Summarize recent checkpoint activity\n  search                     Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  session                    Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\n\nAccount:\n  auth                       Manage authentication\n  login                      Log in to Entire\n  logout                     Log out of Entire\n{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"checkpoints\": {\n    \"primary\": {\n      \"type\": \"git-refs\"\n    }\n  }\n}\ntmp/\nsettings.local.json\nmetadata/\nlogs/\nredactors/local/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5dfc4e1c-4d34-47c8-b73b-266e38c87d45","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","root":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":6,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"max-gsnr/Final-Hack-EHL","visibility":"unknown"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"max-gsnr/Final-Hack-EHL","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"max-gsnr/Final-Hack-EHL","visibility":"unknown"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"de7c5181-429f-45e2-acab-d9002efc5540","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","sessionId":"944dad4c-792b-4da5-b8a1-9392d6587dfe","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"misty-brewing-feather"}
