{"parentUuid":"7430cefe-93bb-43f7-95f7-564717591c50","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d664b782-ff13-41ae-98ac-3cd37747011e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019JWmFRPiF1wf9t6RdmAwfW","type":"tool_result","content":"● Enabled · branch main\n  Agents · Codex\n  ! Codex-discovered hooks are out of date · run 'entire doctor'\n  Checkpoints sync to: origin\nAgents: run `entire agent-help` for machine-readable usage.\n---\nView and manage agent sessions tracked by Entire.\n\nCommands:\n  list     List all sessions across all worktrees\n  info     Show detailed information for a specific session\n  tokens   Show token usage and optimization recommendations\n  stop     Stop one or more active sessions\n  current  Show the active session for the current worktree\n  attach   Attach an existing agent session\n  adopt    Adopt an active session from another worktree\n  resume   Switch to a branch and resume its session\n\nExamples:\n  entire session list                      List all sessions\n  entire session info <session-id>         Show session details\n  entire session info <session-id> --json  Output as JSON\n  entire session tokens <session-id>       Show token usage\n  entire session stop                      Interactive stop\n  entire session current                   Active session for cwd\n  entire session attach <session-id>       Attach an external session\n  entire session adopt <session-id> --from ../repo  Adopt a moved session\n  entire session resume <branch>           Resume from a branch\n\nUsage:\n  entire session [command]\n\nAliases:\n  session, sessions\n\nAvailable Commands:\n---\nAgents:\n    antigravity\n    claude-code\n  ✓ codex\n    copilot-cli\n    cursor\n    factoryai-droid\n    opencode\n    pi","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5d8ea9bf-2ce2-4883-8876-b50221afe97b","timestamp":"2026-10-11T11:53:39.103Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"● Enabled · branch main\n  Agents · Codex\n  ! Codex-discovered hooks are out of date · run 'entire doctor'\n  Checkpoints sync to: origin\nAgents: run `entire agent-help` for machine-readable usage.\n---\nView and manage agent sessions tracked by Entire.\n\nCommands:\n  list     List all sessions across all worktrees\n  info     Show detailed information for a specific session\n  tokens   Show token usage and optimization recommendations\n  stop     Stop one or more active sessions\n  current  Show the active session for the current worktree\n  attach   Attach an existing agent session\n  adopt    Adopt an active session from another worktree\n  resume   Switch to a branch and resume its session\n\nExamples:\n  entire session list                      List all sessions\n  entire session info <session-id>         Show session details\n  entire session info <session-id> --json  Output as JSON\n  entire session tokens <session-id>       Show token usage\n  entire session stop                      Interactive stop\n  entire session current                   Active session for cwd\n  entire session attach <session-id>       Attach an external session\n  entire session adopt <session-id> --from ../repo  Adopt a moved session\n  entire session resume <branch>           Resume from a branch\n\nUsage:\n  entire session [command]\n\nAliases:\n  session, sessions\n\nAvailable Commands:\n---\nAgents:\n    antigravity\n    claude-code\n  ✓ codex\n    copilot-cli\n    cursor\n    factoryai-droid\n    opencode\n    pi","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"25aa71bf-683e-4cc7-aba4-8ad7cf2b8788","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","root":"/Users/abdulrafaymohammed/Documents/Privat/Hackathons/EHL Final/Final-Hack-EHL","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":6,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":